# Frontend React / Inertia Rules

## File placement

```
resources/js/
  pages/          → Inertia views (one per route)
  components/     → reusable UI (ui/ for shadcn primitives)
  hooks/          → reusable React logic
  lib/            → pure TS helpers, brand-colors
  types/          → shared interfaces
  layouts/        → app shells
```

## Page rules

- Export default page component; set `Page.layout` when needed.
- Use Inertia `Form`, `Link`, `Head` — not raw `<form action>`.
- Receive data via props from Controller only; no hidden business rules.
- Arabic UI text; RTL via global `dir="rtl"` (except login override).

## Component rules

- Presentational: props in, JSX out.
- Use semantic Tailwind tokens (`bg-primary`, `text-brand-navy`) per `brand-colors.mdc`.
- Colocate small sub-components; extract when reused 2+ times.

## Data flow

```
Controller → Inertia::render('page', props) → Page → Components
```

Never call Laravel routes logic from `lib/`; use Wayfinder routes (`@/routes`).

## Naming

- Pages: `dashboard.tsx`, `families/index.tsx`
- Components: PascalCase file and export
- Hooks: `use-*.tsx`
